Maintainer decision, recorded as charter D11: a solution is built and tested separately in the lab before it is committed. It goes into the product only once it has been seen working there.

For this issue that test is:
- a clean MSI install;
- an upgrade from the current installed build, with existing settings and connections in place;
- a check that those settings and connections are still read, and that Help → About and the log show the right edition.

The lab already has an installer runner ...
